graph TB
    Start([Developer Writes Code]) --> UnitTest{Run Unit Tests}

    UnitTest -->|Pass| TypeCheck{Type Check}
    UnitTest -->|Fail| FixUnit[Fix Unit Tests]
    FixUnit --> UnitTest

    TypeCheck -->|Pass| Lint{Lint Check}
    TypeCheck -->|Fail| FixType[Fix Type Errors]
    FixType --> TypeCheck

    Lint -->|Pass| Build{Build All Apps}
    Lint -->|Fail| FixLint[Fix Lint Errors]
    FixLint --> Lint

    Build -->|Pass| E2E{Run E2E Tests}
    Build -->|Fail| FixBuild[Fix Build Errors]
    FixBuild --> Build

    E2E -->|Pass| Coverage{Check Coverage}
    E2E -->|Fail| FixE2E[Fix E2E Tests]
    FixE2E --> E2E

    Coverage -->|>= 80%| CI[Push to CI/CD]
    Coverage -->|< 80%| AddTests[Add More Tests]
    AddTests --> UnitTest

    CI --> GHActions{GitHub Actions}

    GHActions --> ParallelTests[Run Tests in Parallel]
    ParallelTests --> UnitTests[Unit Tests]
    ParallelTests --> IntegrationTests[Integration Tests]
    ParallelTests --> E2ETests[E2E Tests]

    UnitTests --> Merge{All Pass?}
    IntegrationTests --> Merge
    E2ETests --> Merge

    Merge -->|Yes| Deploy[Deploy to Production]
    Merge -->|No| NotifyDev[Notify Developer]
    NotifyDev --> FixUnit

    Deploy --> Success([Deployment Complete])

    style Start fill:#34d399
    style Success fill:#34d399
    style UnitTest fill:#60a5fa
    style TypeCheck fill:#60a5fa
    style Lint fill:#60a5fa
    style Build fill:#60a5fa
    style E2E fill:#60a5fa
    style Coverage fill:#60a5fa
    style FixUnit fill:#f59e0b
    style FixType fill:#f59e0b
    style FixLint fill:#f59e0b
    style FixBuild fill:#f59e0b
    style FixE2E fill:#f59e0b
    style AddTests fill:#f59e0b
    style Deploy fill:#a78bfa
